# Imsprog
===
A software for CH341A-based programmers to work with I2C, SPI and MicroWire EEPROM/Flash chips
 
IMSProg - I2C, MicroWire and SPI EEPROM/Flash chip Programmer - is a program to read, write EEPROM chips use the CH341A programmer device, CH347T programmer device and FT232H v1.2 programmer device.

IMSProg is a collection of tools:
 1. IMSProg - the chip programmer (it's the main part).
 2. IMSProg_editor - chip database editor.
 3. IMSProg_database_update - update chip database using external web-server.
 
